{"steam_appid":1939100,"steam_name":"Go Home Annie: An SCP Game","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1939100/301551519/00f69daf0c1b2f620053234233d5a7b7f070d1b0/1774272857/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774962128","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257307776/a9567ac8fd149cc339eefaf391c92c44cf90afff/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1774962128","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/ss_2cd55908063b194b18faca0444fdec125e2d4c9f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774962131","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/ss_c71a41ddf91a1a89da62c2e7f0c16fd51386e23b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774962131","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/ss_7d07f3526cb5ac20c84bace7e914517ec395b2a3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774962131","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/ss_efd87591fd28363b72422a5ddb4345fced0b5370.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774962131","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/7815d14f2ecf1885c543c0d6f188006cf6aae305/ss_7815d14f2ecf1885c543c0d6f188006cf6aae305.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774962131"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/7eaabea47ede676c2dd69699723d9e80.poster.avif?t=1774962131\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/7eaabea47ede676c2dd69699723d9e80.webm?t=1774962131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/7eaabea47ede676c2dd69699723d9e80.mp4?t=1774962131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on the role of Annie, a low level employee of the SCP Foundation, a covert organization meant to secure and contain anomalous entities and protect the general public from them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why has an organization with the motto &quot;Secure, Contain, Protect&quot; created a division for replicating dangerous paranormal events and anomalous entities? Why are you tasked with repeatedly testing the same replicas, with a seemingly never changing outcome? You will need to take drastic actions to uncover your true purpose and alter the course of your fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/462de1b96d169f692ec48fdb1f40fc9e.poster.avif?t=1774962131\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/462de1b96d169f692ec48fdb1f40fc9e.webm?t=1774962131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/462de1b96d169f692ec48fdb1f40fc9e.mp4?t=1774962131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted gameplay mechanics: utilize existing and original anomalies to solve puzzles and navigate levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/96fa0806f356ae0acf291ef44330a1ae.poster.avif?t=1774962131\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/96fa0806f356ae0acf291ef44330a1ae.webm?t=1774962131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/96fa0806f356ae0acf291ef44330a1ae.mp4?t=1774962131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the mysterious facility: from terrifying experiments, to loose subjects, no place in the Replication Division is completely safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/88f5b7fc639b2b515aae4fa8a67ec66c.poster.avif?t=1774962131\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/88f5b7fc639b2b515aae4fa8a67ec66c.webm?t=1774962131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/88f5b7fc639b2b515aae4fa8a67ec66c.mp4?t=1774962131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our take on the SCP Universe: if you're familiar with the stories of the SCP Foundation, you will find a lot to love. Besides the most popular ones, you will meet and interact with many hidden gems of the existing SCP Foundation Lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/6b4f6316b6bb86b5ba2ed66c5faf4d70.poster.avif?t=1774962131\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/6b4f6316b6bb86b5ba2ed66c5faf4d70.webm?t=1774962131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939100/extras/6b4f6316b6bb86b5ba2ed66c5faf4d70.mp4?t=1774962131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4th gen Intel i5 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 760 or AMD Radeon HD 7950<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 35 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Target: low settings, 720p, 30fps</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4th gen Intel i7 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1070 or AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 35 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Target: high settings, 1080p, 60fps</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Misfit Village"],"publishers":["Nordcurrent Labs"],"release_date":"10 Dec, 2024"}